//! Generated keyword tables — do not edit by hand.
//!
//! Sources:
//! - Postgres `src/include/parser/kwlist.h`, branch REL_18_STABLE
//! - SQLite `tool/mkkeywordhash.c`, branch master
//!
//! Regenerate by re-fetching those files and rebuilding the arrays with
//! the same shape (name, category), sorted for binary search.

